+/*
+ * GLYMUR-A16: drop the two secondary PMICs this laptop does not populate, and
+ * the thermal zones left dangling behind them.
+ *
+ * The zones must be deleted BY PATH, not by label. Upstream leaves
+ * pmh0104-l1-thermal and pmh0110-h0-thermal unlabelled (only the i0/j0 zones
+ * carry labels), so `/delete-node/ &pmh0104_l1_thermal;` fails to resolve and
+ * the zone survives with a dangling thermal-sensors phandle into the PMIC we
+ * just removed - which is a hard dtc error:
