+	/*
+	 * GLYMUR-A16: drop com_aux. gcc_usb3_tert_phy_com_aux_clk never leaves
+	 * halt on this instance - phy@88e1000 has no DWC3 behind it (there is no
+	 * tertiary USB controller), so the vote a USB half would normally cast is
+	 * never made. qmp_combo_com_init() then fails -EBUSY after a 200us
+	 * timeout, which kills AUX, EDID and every mode on the HDMI output.
+	 *
+	 * Legal because qmp_combo_clk_init() fetches the fixed list
+	 * {aux, cfg_ahb, ref, com_aux} with devm_clk_bulk_get_optional(): a clock
+	 * absent from the DT comes back NULL and clk_bulk_enable() skips it.
+	 * cfg_ahb already proves this - it is missing from all three combo PHY
+	 * nodes and nothing complains.
