+	 * Result: 0 clk-branch WARNs, EDID 0 -> 512 bytes, modes 0 -> 32, and the
+	 * compositor no longer wedges in msm_dp_aux_transfer on hotplug.
+	 *
+	 * WORKAROUND, not the correct fix. The DT describes the PHY's clocks
+	 * accurately; the driver is what enables com_aux unconditionally for an
+	 * instance with no USB half. The real fix likely belongs in
+	 * phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c or GCC. Do NOT present this upstream as
+	 * "the DTS was wrong".
+	 *
